On evAfter
	Calculate cTargetPath as $cinst.$shortPath(cTargetPath) ## any of the four fronts; a path that does not resolve stays as typed
	Set reference iTargetRef to iTools.$pathToRefQuiet(cTargetPath) ## silent, reads Lib.Class, and agrees with the colour $redrawPathField gives the field
	Do $cinst.$logSetValues()
	Do $cfield.$redraw()
	
	
On evKey
	If pSystemKey=kTabKey&#SHIFT
		# in field order
	Else If pSystemKey=kTabKey
		# in field order
	End If